\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
我們一切仇敵、四圍的外邦人聽見了便懼怕，愁眉不展；因為見這工作完成是\textbf{\color{HandClay!80!black}出乎我們的神}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
When all our enemies heard of it, and all the nations surrounding us saw it, they
lost their confidence; for they recognized that this work had been accomplished
\textbf{with the help of our God}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterStone} 尼希米記 6:16 \textperiodcentered\ Nehemiah 6:16
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十三章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 十三篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 四卷 \textperiodcentered\ 神先動人的心，牆為話語而造\\
\textit{Thirteen chapters of Nehemiah in thirteen studies \textperiodcentered\ four volumes \textperiodcentered\ God moves the heart first; the wall is built for the Word}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：憂與禱 & 1-2篇 & 神先使人憂傷；施恩的手，不用神蹟 \\
卷二：牆與敵 & 3-6篇 & 各人修各人的一段；五十二天，仇敵也承認出乎神 \\
卷三：書與樂 & 7-10篇 & 水門前一本被讀的書；哭、樂、認罪、立約 \\
卷四：城與誓 & 11-13篇 & 十人取一；兩班歌唱；誓約被破，「求你記念我」 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部工程紀錄，是來看神怎樣先使一個人憂傷，再藉一堵牆把百姓帶回一本書。\\
牆五十二天完工，圍得住外敵，圍不住人心；書以一句禱告作結。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Not a construction log: God first grieves one man, then uses a wall to bring His
people back to a book. The wall kept out enemies, not the heart; the book ends in prayer.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

